OL,3,GNEWSACommunity theatre could undergo
OL,4,Amajor revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FA century-old theatre bought by a
OL,7,Fcharity last year is set for a major
OL,8,Frefurbishment, according to new plans.
OL,10,FThe Novello Theatre in Sunninghill High
OL,11,FStreet dates back to the 1920s and was
OL,12,Fowned by the Royal Borough of Windsor
OL,13,Fand Maidenhead (RBWM) from 1966 until
OL,14,Flast year.
OL,16,FRBWM had earmarked it for potential
OL,17,Fdemolition in its 2024/25 budget
OL,18,Fbecause of the "prohibitive" #1m cost
OL,19,Fof doing it up but it was sold to the
OL,20,FSunninghill Trust last year.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
