OL,3,GNEWSACommunity theatre could undergo
OL,4,Amajor revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow known as The Picture House Theatre,
OL,7,Fthe trust has submitted its refurb
OL,8,Fplans for the venue, while another
OL,9,Ftrust wants to renovate a hall next
OL,10,Fdoor.
